  partName: Exhaust Manifold Mounting Bracket
  description: The Exhaust Manifold Mounting Bracket is an elongated, tiny component
    situated at the middle-center-front of the engine, constructed from Material.008,
    which offers high strength-to-weight ratio. This bracket serves as a critical
    mounting point for the exhaust manifold, enabling the secure attachment of the
    exhaust system to the engine. Interestingly, the bracket's elongated shape allows
    for flexibility in exhaust manifold design and configuration.
